    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin integrates <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates/\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates</a>, <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-pro/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Pro</a> and <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-enterprise/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Enterprise</a> with <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/formidable/\" rel=\"ugc\">Formidable Forms</a> and <a href=\"https://formidablepro.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Formidable Pro</a>.</p>\n<p>This integration features:<br />\n&#8211; Affiliates can sign up through forms handled with Formidable Forms.<br />\n&#8211; Form submissions that are referred through affiliates, can grant commissions to affiliates and record referral details.</p>\n<p>Requirements:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/formidable/\" rel=\"ugc\">Formidable Forms</a> : Please note that you must use version 2 or later and we recommend the latest version.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates/\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates</a> or <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-pro/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Pro</a> or <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-enterprise/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Enterprise</a> : This integration works fully with all versions.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates-formidable\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates Formidable</a> : This plugin.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Documentation:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates/setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates-pro//setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates Pro</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates-enterprise/setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates Enterprise</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/formidable/\" rel=\"ugc\">Formidable Forms</a> version 2 or later.</li>\n<li>Install and activate <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates/\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates</a> or <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-pro/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Pro</a> or <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-enterprise/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Enterprise</a>.</li>\n<li>Install and activate this integration plugin <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates-formidable\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates Formidable</a>.</li>\n<li>Use form actions to enable affiliate registration and/or affiliate commissions through referrals for desired forms. Please refer to the documentation for details.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Note that you can install the plugins from your WordPress installation directly: use the <em>Add new</em> option found in the <em>Plugins</em> menu.<br />\nYou can also upload and extract them in your site&#8217;s <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory or use the <em>Upload</em> option.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='documentation'>\nDocumentation\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates/setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates-pro//setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates Pro</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates-enterprise/setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates Enterprise</a></li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<p>See <a href=\"https://plugins.svn.wordpress.org/affiliates-formidable/trunk/changelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">changelog.txt</a>.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Integrates Affiliates, Affiliates Pro and Affiliates Enterprise with Formidable Forms and Formidable Pro.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin integrates <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates/\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates</a>, <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-pro/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Pro</a> and <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-enterprise/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Enterprise</a> with <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/formidable/\" rel=\"ugc\">Formidable Forms</a> and <a href=\"https://formidablepro.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Formidable Pro</a>.</p>\n<p>This integration features:<br />\n&#8211; Affiliates can sign up through forms handled with Formidable Forms.<br />\n&#8211; Form submissions that are referred through affiliates, can grant commissions to affiliates and record referral details.</p>\n<p>Requirements:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/formidable/\" rel=\"ugc\">Formidable Forms</a> : Please note that you must use version 2 or later and we recommend the latest version.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates/\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates</a> or <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-pro/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Pro</a> or <a href=\"https://www.itthinx.com/shop/affiliates-enterprise/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Affiliates Enterprise</a> : This integration works fully with all versions.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/affiliates-formidable\" rel=\"ugc\">Affiliates Formidable</a> : This plugin.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Documentation:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates/setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates-pro//setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates Pro</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.itthinx.com/document/affiliates-enterprise/setup/settings/integrations/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration with Affiliates Enterprise</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/affiliates-formidable.3.3.0.zip",
    "upgrade_notice": {
        "": "<p>This version is compatible with the latest versions of WordPress, Affiliates, Affiliates Pro and Affiliates Enterprise.\nSupport for formula-based rates requires Affiliates Pro &gt;= 4.x or Affiliates Enterprise &gt;= 4.x.</p>"
    },
